          <li><a href="https://istss.org/clinical-resources/treating-trauma/new-istss-prevention-and-treatment-guidelines/" target="_blank" rel="noopener external" class="text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800 font-medium">ISTSS — Complex PTSD Prevention and Treatment Guidelines</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5774423/" target="_blank" rel="noopener external" class="text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800 font-medium">Karatzias, Cloitre, Maercker et al., 2017 — ITQ ICD-11</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7919312/" target="_blank" rel="noopener external" class="text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800 font-medium">Maercker et al., 2020 — Desenvolvimento diagnóstico</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.ptsd.va.gov/professional/articles/article-pdf/id52075.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener external" class="text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800 font-medium">VA/DoD 2021 — Intervenções ICD-11</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://site.cfp.org.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener external" class="text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800 font-medium">CFP — Resolução 06/2019</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="section-h text-2xl">Perguntas frequentes</h2>
